There is a way to carry boulders without polymorphing even when HARD
is defined. (Possible **spoiler** follows)

If you are not carrying very much, then instead of getting the message
"with a great effort you move the boulder" or "you try to move the
boulder, but in vain", you will get the message "but wait, there is a
small opening", and you will move in the same space as the boulder
itself. Then, if you are strong enough, you can pick it up. Generally,
you have to have gauntlets of power or be something Big and Nasty to
be strong enough, but if you take advantage of Ye Olde Bag of Holding
Scam and make it so you can pick up and carry 100's of rocks and
corpses at once, then you will not only be able to pick up the
boulders, but also always be able to squeeze into the same space as
them (since the routine is based on how much you can *still* carry,
not how much you *are* carrying). [BTW, the bag of holding scam is
useful for hell too, when checking to see if that darn up staircase
happens to be under one of the boulders, among other things.]

